===Etymology 1===
{{wikipedia|lang=ca|Català salat}}
So called because the people are said to use {{m-self|ca|sa}} instead of {{m|ca|la}}. The resemblance with the past participle of {{l|ca|salar|gloss=to salt}} is coincidental.

